format session-log-v1
stamp 20260822.213621
editor Claude Code
model claude-opus-5
voice Kyri
host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title The queue learns to price itself, and the arc takes its first lift chosen by cost
prompt Standfast on reds, then the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first on the Caravan ladder arc; deep-read one council-rota row; refresh REMEMBER; send.
think Read KYRI and RADIANT_STYLE first, then crux/REMEMBER.md, then the top rows of session-logs/README.md. The running thread is the Caravan ladder lift arc, and the last three recommends all pointed at the same turn -- answered_by leads the fold queue at a fall of 330 while carrying widens=68.
think Standfast first. crux/REDS.md rows %144 and %145 both read CLOSED with witnesses on metal, so no red booked the allocation and constructive work was free to begin.
think Ran sh tools/fixtures/ladder_reach_visibility_scan.sh queue and then the per-family scan on all twelve rows, which is where the lap turned. answered_by prices widens_fn=34 and widens_const=34 -- thirty-four rungs each publishing a private function and a private record type. recant_note beneath it returns 324 with every widening column at zero.
think Checked what the arc has actually paid. Every lift on the pin roster -- door_admits at 86, read_own_line at 126, elder_waits at 43, finding_path at 21, judge_outcome at 37 -- widened import bindings and nothing else. Not one published a function or a constant a rung kept private. So the practice has a rule the meter never learned.
think That makes the ordering itself the red rather than the row. The queue answers "what returns the most" where a reader asks "what should I take next," and a hand had corrected its answer two laps running. REDS %145 booked exactly this shape one level up, when the head came off a shortlist rather than a ranking.
obs Booked and closed REDS %146 in the same round. The repair is a free_head beside the head rather than a reordering -- both numbers print and the meter chooses neither, so a lap that judges a price worth paying still reads head. Deciding inside the meter would have hidden the trade the columns exist to show.
obs The RED control is generated rather than tracked, matching the two controls beside it: three rungs of twenty-one lines whose reached helper each keeps private return 36 at three function openings, three rungs of eighteen lines return 30 for nothing, and the mode must name head=costly free_head=frugal rather than costly alone. Proven on metal by prove-red.
obs The copy guard caught three spelled numbers in this lap's own GREEN lines that no assert held -- sixty-eight, twelve, three hundred and twenty-four, and then eleven when the lap count went in. REDS %110's rule with REDS %143's reader doing the catching. All four rewritten to let the asserted numbers carry the claim, which is also the mark law's count-never-number applied to prose.
obs Two ceilings fell together: the carry witness assert and the scan's own CEILING default. Lowering only one leaves the scan blessing a number the suite refuses, which the suits_path lap learned the hard way.
obs Council rota row 1 -- Air/Saturn: TAME_CORE, single-stranded, Conway's law. Conway's inverse names this lap exactly: the communication structure here is made of files, so editing a meter that instructs every future session IS architecture work done in prose. Single-strandedness names why the fix is two columns rather than a reordering -- ranking and pricing are two questions, kept side by side rather than braided into one score.
obs Docs-sync ratchet on touch: single-stranded.md's own banner still claimed active-designing after its 20260821.211423 graduation to foundations, and its Status read Active Design. Both repointed; living_docs_lint GREEN.
loom scan=ladder_reach_visibility_queue families=700 examined=44 wall_s=~40
loom carry=caravan_ladder before=59474 after=59150 fall=324 predicted=324 rungs=37 body_lines=12 stub_lines=3
file tools/fixtures/ladder_reach_visibility_scan.sh queue mode gains free_head/free_fall and the fn/const split per row, plus a generated RED control proving both heads
file tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish queue asserts updated to both heads; the recant_note pin slid from queued to folded; sink totals lowered with the lift
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish carry and bodies asserts lowered to the measured 59150; GREEN prose names this lap
file caravan/ladder_checks.rye recant_note seated as a published comptime-rung function directly above recant_published
file caravan/*.rye thirty-seven rungs fold their twelve-line recant_note body to a three-line stub
file crux/REDS.md REDS %146 booked and closed; headline total and remainder rederived to 146 and 126
file crux/REMEMBER.md Now refilled with the pricing correction and the lift; the hold_the_matter lap folded into prior edges
file foundations/20260618-182412_single-stranded.md banner and Status repointed to the foundations graduation
recommend keep-going bound_the_relay is the free head at 312 -- seven rungs of fifty-five lines, the narrowest and deepest row the queue holds, and the shape this arc has learned returns most per rung. answered_by still leads by return at 330 and still costs sixty-eight openings, so it waits honestly named rather than silently skipped.
